  "job_B3.3.17.2_20261117_184339": {
    "chunk_text": "rig \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e forem\u00e6re man for Gode & his god w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gecy\u00f0ed. & he \u00fea \u00feysne eadigan wer Sanctus Martinus fulfremedlice on Godes \u00e6 & on Godes \u00feeowdom getyde W\u00e6s he swi\u00f0e ge\u00feungen on his \u00f0eawum, & sta\u00f0olf\u00e6st on his wordum, & hluttor & cl\u00e6ne on hie life; & \u00dea gelamp \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees eadiga wer Sanctus Martinus sum mynster getimbrede, & he on \u00f0\u00e6m \u00dea gelamp sume si\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r com sum gecristnod man to him, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde mid his lare & mid his \u00dea w\u00e6s he \u00fe\u00e6r dagas wel manige; \u00fea wear\u00f0 he untrum on feforadle. \u00dea gelamp on \u00fea tid \u00fe\u00e6t Sanctus Martinus w\u00e6s on sumre fore ealle \u00fery dagas; \u00f0a he eft ham com, \u00fea \u00dea he \u00fea Sanctus Martinus \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea o\u00f0re bro\u00f0or ealle swa unrote ymb \u00fe\u00e6t lic utan stondan, & him w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00fee myccle weorce \u00fe\u00e6t he swa ungefulwad for\u00f0feran sceolde; getrywde \u00fea hwe\u00f0re & eode \u00fea on \u00fea cetan \u00fe\u00e6r se lichoma inne w\u00e6s, & heht \u00f0a o\u00f0re men ut gangan, & \u00fea \u00f0a duru inbeleac & hine \u00f0a geb\u00e6d, & hine astreahte ofer leomu \u00fe\u00e6s deadan mannes. \u00dea he \u00fea lange hwile on \u00fe\u00e6m gebede w\u00e6s, \u00fea ongeat he \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s godcundlic m\u00e6gen ondweard, & \u00dea w\u00e6s ymb hwile, \u00f0a gefe",
